  "title": "Low-Fat Vegan Pumpkin Chocolate Chip Muffins",
  "description": "Tasty low-fat vegan muffins rely on pumpkin for flavor and moist texture. Chocolate chips will make them disappear in a hurry.",
  "authors": [
